.TH VORCHESTRATOR 1 "March 2026" "vorchestrator 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
vorchestrator \- Token-efficient multi-agent task orchestrator for Antigravity
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vorchestrator
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B vorchestrator
is an Antigravity orchestrator plugin providing tier-routed worker delegation across Gemini and Claude quota pools, self-scaling successor coordinators, and Jules session offloading.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR jules-vanager (1)
